IV. EXAMPLES
We formulate our optimization problems in YALMIP [27], a MATLAB-based toolbox and we use the SeDuMi solver 1, which can be accessed from YALMIP, to solve the convex optimization problems. In some cases, the discrete-time plant models were obtained from their continuous transfer functions using the MATLAB-based System Identification Toolbox (V7.3). The optimization problems were solved on an Intel Core2 Duo CPU with 1.96 GB RAM. We would like to point out that different feasible solutions may result on different machines and with different optimization solvers.
